build @test/operations/scans                            names nothing
    <the configuration does not count>
build @test/operations/scans answers names nothing: true
build @test/operations/runtest-bandwidth_calibration    names nothing + reads config
    it reaches the rule producing bandwidth_calibration.actual in test/operations, which reads the configuration
build @test/operations/runtest-bandwidth_calibration answers names nothing + reads config: true
